# Images the labs start, pinned by tag AND digest. The digest is the
# pin; the tag is there for humans. docs/versions.md says why each one
# and when it was last verified. lib/lab.sh sources this file; the
# weekly at-latest CI job swaps it for a generated images.latest.env.

# llama.cpp server v0.4.1, which the project maps to build b10964
# (commit b29c606e2). The image has llama-server as its entrypoint
# and a multi-call /app/llama for `llama bench`, `llama perplexity`.
LLAMA_CPP_IMAGE=ghcr.io/ggml-org/llama.cpp:server-v0.4.1@sha256:283ed1799f2711361dadd863305ffe31c9fca3321a099712a8cc65061502b523

# vLLM's official CPU image (multi-arch: amd64 + arm64).
